# Chronicle and usage hashes cover exact bytes; checkout must not translate them.
# Activity migrations also retain exact original documents and metadata bytes.
.hai_env/activities/** -text whitespace=blank-at-eol,blank-at-eof,space-before-tab,cr-at-eol
.hai_env/activities/**/chronicles/** -text
.hai_env/activities/**/usage.md -text
.hai_env/activities/**/usage.json -text
# Workflow snapshots, events and artifact manifests also require exact bytes.
# Match configured Activity stores as well as the default environment location.
**/workflow-runs/** -text
# Layout-2 runtime records and retained predecessors/evidence are byte-preserving.
**/system/chat.jsonl -text
**/system/chronicles/** -text
**/system/usage.md -text
**/system/usage.json -text
**/history/** -text
**/evidence/** -text
